<title>UK: SOCCER-DI CANIO VOTED BEST PLAYER IN SCOTLAND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DI CANIO VOTED BEST PLAYER IN SCOTLAND.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celtic's Italian striker Paolo Di Canio was named Scotland's Players' Player of the Year on Sunday, the first from the Parkhead club to receive the award since 1991.</p>
</text>
